      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name} \n\nYes, I’m aware that this can be mitigated by increasing the maximum particle count.\n\nFor my own avatar, I can make the necessary adjustments myself. Also, if this only affected the PC version, I would consider the workaround reasonable. \n\nHowever, there are two issues:\n\n- The maximum particle count affects the avatar performance rank, and increasing it would cause the Quest version to drop from Poor to Very Poor.\n\n- Existing avatars that use this technique and are no longer being updated would remain broken.\n\nBecause of these two issues, I felt that I had to report this as a bug rather than treat it solely as something that can be addressed with a workaround.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
