      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{632189004cdd7244bce8f3cf|full_name}: For affecting the performance rank, that is correct. In the sense that there are, in fact, that many particles - so the performance rank should show that.\n\nAs for breaking existing content - that is true, which is why we haven't ruled out a fix. We're trying to understand the impact. Do you know how many avatars this would affect? I suspect, given how late in the unity-6 beta cycle it was reported, it wouldn't be that many.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
